IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nusca-university`

-- National University of Singapore (Corporatisation) Act 2005, ss 7-10, 13, 14, 16-20 and First and Second Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_national-university-of-singapore-corporatisation-act-2005.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 7`

#ASSERT `the Minister's prior written consent is required` `admitting a member of the company`
#ASSERT `the Minister's prior written consent is required` `selling substantially the whole undertaking`
#ASSERT NOT `the Minister's prior written consent is required` `selling one building`
#ASSERT `the Minister's prior written consent is required` `voluntarily winding up the company`
#ASSERT `the Minister's prior written consent is required` `amending the articles of association`
#ASSERT `the Minister's prior written consent is required` `removing a trustee`
#ASSERT NOT `the Minister's prior written consent is required` `appointing a trustee`

#ASSERT NOT `the act has no effect and is unenforceable` `removing a trustee` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the act has no effect and is unenforceable` `removing a trustee` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the act has no effect and is unenforceable` `removing a trustee` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the act has no effect and is unenforceable` `appointing a trustee` FALSE FALSE

